WEBVTT

00:01:31.410 --> 00:01:33.340
Our vows.

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:36.980
In sickness and in health,

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:40.010
through happiness and sadness,
for richer, for poorer...

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:47.890
I promise to...

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:50.520
love you...

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:08.910
Satou-chan isn't back yet.

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:10.940
I wonder what's wrong...

00:02:11.870 --> 00:02:13.080
What if

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:16.210
she never comes back...

00:02:49.870 --> 00:02:51.480
Outside?

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:55.540
Satou-chan's outside, right?

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:57.630
But Satou-chan

00:02:57.630 --> 00:03:00.920
told me it's dangerous outside.

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:09.800
It's okay.

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:11.890
I'll go with you.

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:14.840
That's right...

00:03:19.980 --> 00:03:48.180
Satou-chan.

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:50.180
Satou-chan, where are you?

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:51.930
Where are you?

00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:54.390
Why aren't you coming home?

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:56.850
I have to destroy him.

00:03:57.850 --> 00:04:01.970
No! No! Don't leave me!

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:04.090
I have to hurry and...

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:06.720
Satou-chan!

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:16.910
Oh, Matsuzaka. Sorry to leave you here.

00:04:16.910 --> 00:04:18.960
I just got ahold of the manager.

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:22.090
No worries.

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:24.780
I'm okay. Don't worry about it.

00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:31.300
Asahi.... Asahi...

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:33.460
Come get me soon.

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:41.300
Oh! You're back! Thank goodness.

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:46.790
Are you okay?
You shouldn't move around yet.

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:49.470
At least you didn't break any bones.

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:52.480
Anyway, the manager is coming now.

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:54.450
-I'm going home.
-Huh?

00:04:58.190 --> 00:04:59.900
But... Wait!

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:02.820
I'm sure there's a hospital that's open where...

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:05.700
I'm guessing you live nearby, then?

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:11.510
Oh, I see! Let me take you home.

00:05:11.510 --> 00:05:13.160
I'm worried, you know.

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:18.270
-Okay?
-It doesn't matter.

00:05:19.430 --> 00:05:23.880
Sorry for giving you trouble. And...

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:26.820
sorry for dirtying your sofa.

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:30.400
Is he going to be okay?

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:32.910
I hope he makes it home.

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:37.040
I know I shouldn't be too pushy.

00:05:38.950 --> 00:05:41.770
Let's go home too, Matsuzaka.

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:43.920
Huh?

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:12.160
I couldn't control my emotions.

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:15.020
That was close.

00:06:15.860 --> 00:06:17.020
If...

00:06:17.990 --> 00:06:20.250
I had destroyed that thing right there...

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:28.700
But what is this feeling?

00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:31.620
I'm not new to bitter tastes.

00:06:37.090 --> 00:06:39.770
But this was on a totally different level.

00:06:40.430 --> 00:06:42.940
Just remembering it brings back the bitter taste.

00:06:43.480 --> 00:06:44.940
What is this?

00:06:45.890 --> 00:06:47.760
What is this feeling?

00:06:48.360 --> 00:06:50.980
Anger? Pain?

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:52.940
A warning sign?

00:06:52.940 --> 00:06:55.740
It's different from any emotion
I've ever felt before.

00:06:56.860 --> 00:06:59.540
It's bitter. Bitter.

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:04.290
No, stop thinking about it!

00:07:05.620 --> 00:07:08.710
If I lose control,
I'll lose my life with Shio-chan too.

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:12.260
I have to understand it to control it.

00:07:18.550 --> 00:07:20.500
Back there,

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:22.350
I imagined that

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:25.140
Shio-chan and that thing

00:07:25.140 --> 00:07:28.440
said those vows to each other.

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:31.150
And then

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:34.020
I felt a bitter taste spreading through my mouth.

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:35.910
I couldn't stand it.

00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:43.830
I can't stand

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:46.380
having the person I love be with someone else.

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:49.460
Is this jealousy?

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:54.050
Jealousy.

00:08:01.970 --> 00:08:03.370
Jealousy?!

00:08:03.890 --> 00:08:06.290
I'm glad! Because...

00:08:07.060 --> 00:08:08.600
this emotion,

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:10.440
this pain,

00:08:10.440 --> 00:08:14.530
was born from my love of Shio-chan, right?

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:19.910
My first emotion.

00:08:21.030 --> 00:08:22.740
Hey, girl.

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:25.120
Heading home?

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:26.920
Want to hang out with us?

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:29.840
Sorry.

00:08:31.290 --> 00:08:34.360
The person I love is waiting for me at home.

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:36.990
Thanks, Shio-chan.

00:08:37.510 --> 00:08:40.600
I feel like I've been reborn again.

00:08:41.930 --> 00:08:44.460
Ah, I can't wait to get home!

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:46.310
Back to my dear

00:08:46.310 --> 00:08:48.270
happy sugar life.

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:03.740
You're just so cute,
Shio Koube.
Shio Koube
Missing

00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:05.100
I'M LOOKING FOR
SHIO KOUBE
Shio Koube
Missing

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:08.830
But what happened, Shio-chan?

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:10.550
Were you kidnapped?

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:12.380
No way.

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:15.020
Huh? I feel like

00:09:15.020 --> 00:09:18.450
I saw this flyer lying around in the park too.

00:09:32.690 --> 00:09:35.510
I thought it didn't matter, but...

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:40.700
I'm going to make sure
that thing and Shio-chan never meet.

00:09:45.490 --> 00:09:48.120
If he gets in our way...

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:52.250
I'll have to eliminate him strategically.

00:10:01.170 --> 00:10:02.510
It's okay.

00:10:02.510 --> 00:10:05.390
Next time, I'll endure it, no matter how bitter it is.

00:10:05.970 --> 00:10:09.330
Right now I just want Shio-chan to know

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:10.770
how I feel.

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:13.880
I'm home, Shio-chan!

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:38.740
Shio-chan?

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:40.410
She's not here.

00:10:46.470 --> 00:10:49.750
No.

00:10:50.470 --> 00:10:55.590
No. No.

00:10:59.190 --> 00:11:00.610
No.

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:05.870
Shio-chan!

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:22.920
Asahi...

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:26.200
I'm sorry. Asahi.

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:29.830
Hey.

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:32.170
Where are you?

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:35.260
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

00:11:35.260 --> 00:11:36.710
I'm sorry.

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:39.010
I'll be fine.

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:41.340
I'm tough.

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:42.990
Just...

00:11:42.990 --> 00:11:46.060
-take care of Shio.
-But...

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:48.110
It'll be fine.

00:11:48.110 --> 00:11:50.200
God will look after us.

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:54.120
Just go. I promise...

00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:57.000
I'll come to get you some day.

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:59.710
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:05.660
Asahi...

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:08.890
where are you?

00:12:10.930 --> 00:12:14.810
What are you doing? Huh?

00:12:14.810 --> 00:12:18.040
You need to be punished.

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:21.610
If the devil exists in this world...

00:12:22.860 --> 00:12:27.450
then I'm sure this is what it would look like.

00:12:31.700 --> 00:12:33.450
I don't know if

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:35.700
she's alive or if she's safe.

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:36.940
But...

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:38.500
Shio.

00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:40.570
I have to find Shio!

00:12:43.210 --> 00:12:46.760
Where are you, Shio?!

00:12:56.140 --> 00:12:59.300
There are lots of people. I'm scared.

00:12:59.570 --> 00:13:01.630
If I go from that way...

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:03.630
Ouch!

00:13:08.650 --> 00:13:11.570
Satou-chan, I'm scared.

00:13:11.570 --> 00:13:13.410
I'm lonely.

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:14.950
No...

00:13:14.950 --> 00:13:17.150
I don't want to be alone.

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:20.710
Spinning, spinning, spinning...

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:25.500
It's like my head is being twisted.

00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:27.450
What should I do?

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:32.550
Who are you?

00:13:33.680 --> 00:13:35.210
Over here.

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:48.230
My foot hurts. It's cold and it hurts.

00:13:48.230 --> 00:13:51.010
I'm lonely, but...

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:54.100
Huh? What's that?

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:55.190
Hey!

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:57.540
Who are you?

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:03.460
I've been here before.

00:14:07.170 --> 00:14:08.990
Wait!

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:11.830
Wait! Wait!

00:14:12.420 --> 00:14:16.510
But I feel like she was always holding my hand.

00:14:17.140 --> 00:14:19.310
It feels nostalgic.

00:14:34.530 --> 00:14:36.230
Just a little more.

00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:40.150
Did I forget something?

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:43.420
Hey, answer me.

00:14:43.420 --> 00:14:44.980
Who are you?

00:14:55.510 --> 00:14:56.810
No way.

00:14:57.720 --> 00:15:00.140
I never imagined I'd find you here.

00:15:01.640 --> 00:15:03.650
Shio Koube!

00:15:17.070 --> 00:15:18.480
So warm.

00:15:19.070 --> 00:15:22.110
That means she's the real thing.

00:15:24.160 --> 00:15:27.040
Cute little hands...

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:30.510
and fingers. The warmth of a child...

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:35.300
Cute little lips.

00:15:36.050 --> 00:15:40.080
Pure, innocent, big eyes.

00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:45.150
She's so cute. She's so cute.

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:51.060
That's right, there's something

00:15:51.060 --> 00:15:53.190
I've been wanting her to do for me.

00:15:56.530 --> 00:15:57.740
Um...

00:15:58.410 --> 00:16:00.600
Do me a favor.

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:02.700
Please.

00:16:04.620 --> 00:16:08.400
I want you to kiss my boo-boo and make it go away!

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:26.210
Be gone, boo-boo. Be gone!

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:30.770
How come he knows my name?

00:16:31.980 --> 00:16:34.800
Shio Koube.

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:37.280
Koube?

00:16:40.160 --> 00:16:42.120
Are you crying?

00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:45.660
I'm dirty.

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:51.990
Ever since that woman toyed
with my body that day...

00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:57.190
But when you touch me,

00:16:57.190 --> 00:17:00.120
I feel like I'm being purified.

00:17:01.510 --> 00:17:04.390
I feel happy, really happy.

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:08.800
There, there.

00:17:08.800 --> 00:17:11.140
Your hair is a pretty color.

00:17:11.140 --> 00:17:12.650
There, there.

00:17:14.480 --> 00:17:17.650
My name is Taiyou.

00:17:18.650 --> 00:17:20.490
Taiyou Mitsuboshi.

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:22.680
Taiyou?

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:25.350
Then you're Taiyou-kun.

00:17:25.350 --> 00:17:28.310
There, there, Taiyou-kun.

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:30.960
Crying will make you sad, so no crying.

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:35.130
Sorry.

00:17:38.130 --> 00:17:43.600
She's an angel.

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:46.980
She's an angel who comforts me.

00:17:49.220 --> 00:17:51.520
I wasn't wrong.

00:17:53.560 --> 00:17:55.340
The feeling I felt

00:17:55.940 --> 00:17:57.590
when I first saw you...

00:17:58.400 --> 00:18:02.020
The feeling that you're the girl
who will purify me...

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:05.990
it wasn't wrong.

00:18:08.450 --> 00:18:10.860
Shio-chan, I never imagined

00:18:11.660 --> 00:18:14.630
I'd actually meet you.

00:18:14.630 --> 00:18:18.420
God must have noticed my hard work!

00:18:18.420 --> 00:18:20.840
I want you to touch me more!

00:18:20.840 --> 00:18:23.870
More! More!

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:27.140
Make me pure.

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:29.040
Taiyou-kun?

00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:31.230
What's this?

00:18:32.480 --> 00:18:35.940
I did the same thing for that person...

00:18:37.060 --> 00:18:38.980
That person?

00:18:38.980 --> 00:18:41.360
Why can't I remember?

00:18:41.360 --> 00:18:44.700
I feel like I wasn't supposed to forget.

00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:49.850
It hurts. I'm sad.

00:18:50.490 --> 00:18:52.330
For some reason...

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:53.960
really sad.

00:18:54.660 --> 00:18:56.290
I wonder why...

00:18:58.170 --> 00:19:00.620
I don't understand.

00:19:03.170 --> 00:19:04.910
What's wrong?

00:19:08.090 --> 00:19:11.000
I wonder if Satou-chan would know.

00:19:11.810 --> 00:19:14.380
Are you talking about your family?

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:16.890
Family?

00:19:16.890 --> 00:19:19.030
Are you lost?

00:19:21.270 --> 00:19:23.070
They're looking for you.

00:19:23.070 --> 00:19:26.080
Your mom and your dad.

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:29.200
The people you love, who are always with you.

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:33.460
I don't know!

00:19:34.950 --> 00:19:37.090
You're right. Sorry.

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:44.050
Then, how about I bring
the people you love here?

00:19:44.050 --> 00:19:45.950
So you'll be okay.

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:47.260
Satou-chan?

00:19:47.260 --> 00:19:49.600
Right. Satou-chan!

00:19:51.350 --> 00:19:53.600
I see! Taiyou-kun,

00:19:53.600 --> 00:19:55.810
you knew who I am.

00:19:55.810 --> 00:19:59.150
So you must know Satou-chan too.

00:19:59.150 --> 00:20:01.900
I'm counting on you!

00:20:04.850 --> 00:20:07.900
Can you stay at my house until then?

00:20:07.900 --> 00:20:09.230
Okay!

00:20:09.230 --> 00:20:11.770
Right. Until I find her...

00:20:14.370 --> 00:20:16.970
I want this girl

00:20:16.970 --> 00:20:19.420
to purify me even more.

00:20:22.920 --> 00:20:25.380
Taiyou-kun, are you okay?

00:20:29.380 --> 00:20:30.750
I'm fine.

00:20:32.050 --> 00:20:33.750
In order to do that,

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:36.270
maybe I should be the one
touching her next time.

00:20:37.730 --> 00:20:40.360
We could do lots of things.

00:20:41.020 --> 00:20:43.360
If I miss this chance...

00:20:44.570 --> 00:20:47.700
I might never see her again.

00:20:51.740 --> 00:20:53.270
Well, let's go.

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:54.690
Okay.

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:58.180
Oh, God, forgive me.

00:20:58.180 --> 00:21:00.070
Just a little longer.

00:21:00.670 --> 00:21:03.280
It's just for a little longer, so...

00:21:15.180 --> 00:21:19.340
Goodness. Now, there's a blondie that sticks out
like a sore thumb.

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:22.400
Didn't expect you to come back here.

00:21:22.400 --> 00:21:23.840
Are you an idiot?

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:25.060
Oh, well.

00:21:25.060 --> 00:21:28.820
Now we can pay you back
for bothering us earlier.

00:21:51.720 --> 00:21:53.470
Shio-chan.

00:22:00.270 --> 00:22:03.760
-He's so loud.
-Want to bring him to the john?

00:22:04.000 --> 00:22:07.570
Yeah, we can't let anyone see us.

00:22:12.240 --> 00:22:15.200
It hurts again. My head...

00:22:15.700 --> 00:22:17.400
Why?

00:22:17.400 --> 00:22:20.570
Is it because I saw the red thing? Red...

00:22:20.570 --> 00:22:23.360
No. No.

00:22:23.940 --> 00:22:26.750
It hurts. I'm scared.

00:22:27.280 --> 00:22:28.660
No.

00:22:29.550 --> 00:22:31.740
Someone, help me!

00:24:13.400 --> 00:24:17.510
Ever since I met Shio-chan, I just keep changing.

00:24:17.510 --> 00:24:22.890
See? I learned a new emotion tonight too.

00:24:22.920 --> 00:24:25.900
4th Life: "The Sugar Girl Doesn't Notice."
